        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "description": "Sustained (5-min) inference pressure — the money metric over a longer window. Main = main-loop inference pressure. Fleet = fraction of the trailing 300s every active sub-agent was blocked on inference at once (main loop excluded)."
